window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>“Run, Maray, run. But where will you go? There is nowhere safe for you. Not in this world or the other one.”</i></p> <p>With both her mother and grandmother gone, Maray is left with the prospect of the crown—and a marriage she doesn’t want.</p> <p>As if that wasn’t enough, Gan Krai slowly tightens the sling around her neck, setting loose the nightmares of Allinan history.</p> <p>Now, Maray has to decide what type of ruler she wants to become—and what she is willing to sacrifice for it.</p> <p>As Maray is fighting for her standing at court, all of Allinan is watching her every move. And one slip might decide over the fate of everyone she loves.</p> <p><i>Rule of Dominion </i>is the final book in the Two Worlds saga.</p> <p><b>Also in this series:</b></p> <ol> <li>Blood of Two Worlds</li> <li>Heir of Oblivion</li> <li>Knight of Redemption</li> <li>Rule of Dominion</li> </ol>"; 
